WEBVTT

00:22.022 --> 00:22.856
Hi.

00:22.856 --> 00:24.357
I know, I know.

00:24.357 --> 00:25.400
I'm late.

00:25.400 --> 00:27.318
- Don't kill me.
- No promises.

00:29.904 --> 00:32.157
You ready?
Everyone's already on the roof.

00:32.157 --> 00:34.534
I... I gotta
drop this off real quick.

00:34.534 --> 00:35.827
But I'm gonna--

00:36.494 --> 00:37.996
I'm gonna m-meet you up there.

00:37.996 --> 00:39.164
- Okay?
- Alright.

00:39.164 --> 00:40.206
Alright.

00:40.999 --> 00:42.500
- Be quick.
- I will.

00:45.962 --> 00:47.881
We begin now with
some breaking political news

00:47.881 --> 00:49.257
on this Tuesday election night.

00:49.257 --> 00:51.259
Twenty-eight-year-old candidate
Bella Reál

00:51.259 --> 00:54.679
is ahead of Acting Mayor Tomlin
by huge margins...

00:54.679 --> 00:55.680
Hey.

00:58.141 --> 00:59.059
Hey, Ma.

01:11.571 --> 01:13.573
Just remember,
it's called arroz borracho,

01:13.573 --> 01:14.908
not esposo borracho.

01:17.994 --> 01:19.662
These parts were
hard to find, Pá.

01:19.662 --> 01:21.206
- Did you get them?
- I think so.

01:21.206 --> 01:23.458
You... wanted one of those, right?

01:24.042 --> 01:28.296
Y 42s. Like you said.

01:29.798 --> 01:30.715
Good man.

01:34.344 --> 01:35.679
Hooked it up.

01:42.852 --> 01:45.730
You know, M-Manny should

01:45.730 --> 01:48.608
really be paying
you extra, you know.

01:48.608 --> 01:50.944
For finding special parts.

01:50.944 --> 01:53.196
I mean, the guy's got,
like, three garages.

01:53.780 --> 01:54.948
It could be real money for us.

01:54.948 --> 01:56.491
Manny pays me well enough.

01:56.491 --> 01:57.742
Vic is right.

01:57.742 --> 01:59.244
He's taking advantage
of you, Papi.

01:59.244 --> 02:00.453
You see?

02:00.453 --> 02:03.164
You act like wanting more
is a bad thing,

02:03.164 --> 02:06.418
but, I mean, don't you want
a better life than this?

02:06.418 --> 02:07.585
Victor.

02:08.586 --> 02:10.547
If you remembered
where we came from,

02:10.547 --> 02:12.632
we have more than enough.

02:20.890 --> 02:23.268
Okay, G-Graciela's
waiting for me.

02:23.268 --> 02:24.269
I gotta go.

02:24.811 --> 02:26.813
- What about dinner?
- Invite her here.

02:26.813 --> 02:28.314
- We have a lot of food.
- No, no, no.

02:28.314 --> 02:29.524
We'll-- I'll eat later.

02:29.524 --> 02:32.277
C-City Hall's setting off
fireworks f...

02:33.153 --> 02:35.405
for the election so we're just
gonna watch from her roof.

02:35.405 --> 02:37.157
Is Calvin going to be there?

02:37.741 --> 02:39.993
Pá, you don't even know him.

02:39.993 --> 02:42.871
- I know his cousin pushes drugs.
- Okay, so?

02:43.705 --> 02:44.748
Calvin's n...

02:45.957 --> 02:47.792
not a part of Squid's crew.

02:47.792 --> 02:50.378
Can't you just chill out
for once

02:50.378 --> 02:52.255
- and let me see my friends?
- Fine.

02:53.298 --> 02:54.924
- Go.
- Alright.

02:54.924 --> 02:55.842
God.

03:01.181 --> 03:03.600
...the guy then hops the curb, right?

03:03.600 --> 03:05.727
He's now skating down
the sidewalk.

03:05.727 --> 03:07.562
The owner's still chasing him.

03:07.562 --> 03:10.148
Now a dog starts
chasing them too.

03:10.148 --> 03:12.442
And then he turns a corner
and blam!

03:13.068 --> 03:15.612
- A semi slams right into him.
- Was the guy okay?

03:15.612 --> 03:16.905
No. He's dead.

03:17.489 --> 03:19.657
- The dog too.
- Yo!

03:20.658 --> 03:21.868
Why are you telling us this?

03:21.868 --> 03:23.870
'Cause it was fucked up?
I don't know.

03:23.870 --> 03:24.871
Calvin!

03:25.997 --> 03:27.415
Ayo!

03:27.957 --> 03:29.459
Ayo, Squid!

03:29.459 --> 03:31.544
- Calvin, what up, kid?
- What's up, boy?

03:31.544 --> 03:33.713
- How you doing?
- Good.

03:33.713 --> 03:35.507
- Got your re-up.
- You got that good good?

03:35.507 --> 03:37.425
- Thank you. Appreciate it.
- For you, man.

03:38.510 --> 03:39.678
What up, Victor?

03:43.598 --> 03:44.974
I hate Squid.

03:44.974 --> 03:46.726
Yeah, I know. Sorry.

03:46.726 --> 03:48.395
I didn't know he'd be here.

03:48.395 --> 03:50.522
I can't wait to get
out of this shithole.

03:51.648 --> 03:54.025
You should get some flowers,

03:54.734 --> 03:56.903
l-like I got over at my place.

03:56.903 --> 03:58.029
Really...

03:58.988 --> 04:02.242
Really brightens up
the brick walls.

04:06.955 --> 04:08.206
But I dunno.

04:10.500 --> 04:11.918
From up here...

04:14.129 --> 04:15.964
it's kinda nice.

04:16.673 --> 04:18.425
That's 'cause you're
looking far away,

04:18.425 --> 04:20.051
at the rich neighborhoods.

04:20.051 --> 04:22.012
If you were out there
looking back at Crown Point,

04:22.012 --> 04:24.055
you'd say,
"Man, what a shithole."

04:24.973 --> 04:27.142
Come on, I like it here.

04:28.476 --> 04:30.520
You know, I do.
This city, it's...

04:33.690 --> 04:34.858
This city's wild.

04:37.068 --> 04:38.737
It's like anything could happen.

04:40.363 --> 04:41.948
Is this you trying to be smooth?

04:53.168 --> 04:55.086
Is it working?

04:58.298 --> 04:59.507
The show's starting.

05:04.471 --> 05:06.348
- Oh, my God!
- Holy shit!

05:08.683 --> 05:09.893
Are those bombs?

05:09.893 --> 05:11.353
God, they're everywhere.

05:12.103 --> 05:13.063
Whoa! Get down!

06:08.576 --> 06:10.578
You're gettin' forehead grease
all over my window, kid.

06:14.374 --> 06:15.250
Sorry.

06:15.834 --> 06:17.502
Tonight's the night, Vic.

06:18.586 --> 06:20.463
Sofia's
an elusive fuckin' broad,

06:20.463 --> 06:22.924
but she's leadin' us into
a goldmine with Al's new drug.

06:23.633 --> 06:26.177
So then you and...
you and... and...

06:26.845 --> 06:28.471
S-Sofia, is that like...

06:29.180 --> 06:32.517
Are we kinda... partners now?

06:32.517 --> 06:33.810
Temporarily.

06:34.436 --> 06:37.105
Once Luca figures out
that she don't wanna play nice,

06:37.105 --> 06:38.857
the Falcones will take care
of her for us.

06:38.857 --> 06:41.484
But by then, I'll be runnin'
the whole damn trade.

06:41.484 --> 06:43.862
- Isn't Luca her cousin?
- Uncle?

06:43.862 --> 06:45.989
All these fucks are related,
you know?

06:45.989 --> 06:48.450
I mean, 60 years ago,
two Sicilian brothers

06:48.450 --> 06:50.201
jizzed all over
the toe of that boot,

06:50.201 --> 06:53.288
now I got three dozen Falcones
breathin' down my neck.

06:56.791 --> 06:57.834
Kid.

06:58.668 --> 06:59.878
Where's your head at?

07:00.795 --> 07:02.630
You still worked up
about that jewel shit?

07:02.630 --> 07:05.633
As far as I'm concerned,
it's ancient history.

07:05.633 --> 07:07.802
I mean, you fucked up. Huge.

07:08.970 --> 07:10.221
But ya learned, right?

07:10.221 --> 07:12.140
It w-won't happen again.

07:12.140 --> 07:13.475
Good.

07:13.475 --> 07:15.393
'Cause I need your head
in the game.

07:15.393 --> 07:17.103
You're driving me
and Sofia tonight.

07:17.103 --> 07:18.480
I'm-I'm-I'm...

07:19.856 --> 07:21.316
driving both of you?

07:21.316 --> 07:23.610
Yeah. Whaddaya think
the new clothes are for?

07:23.610 --> 07:26.154
You're my guy. Can't have you
lookin' like a schmuck.

07:29.783 --> 07:31.242
Listen, I'm askin' a lot of you.

07:32.285 --> 07:35.038
I get it,
and it just occurred to me

07:35.038 --> 07:36.706
we never discussed your salary.

07:37.624 --> 07:38.833
So...

07:42.587 --> 07:44.089
Boom, there it is.

07:44.964 --> 07:48.635
What do you say
we start you on one a week, huh?

07:48.635 --> 07:50.470
O-One thousand a week?

07:51.304 --> 07:52.180
Are you serious?

07:53.431 --> 07:55.642
And from now on, you want
something, you ask for it.

07:55.642 --> 07:57.060
How's anyone supposed know
your worth

07:57.060 --> 07:58.770
unless you tell 'em, huh?

07:58.770 --> 07:59.896
I want two thousand.

08:02.190 --> 08:04.025
That's what I'm talking about.

08:04.025 --> 08:05.860
But no. There she is.

08:12.951 --> 08:14.577
Fuck, Blackgate.

08:14.577 --> 08:17.122
Gotta be Sal.
I need to take this.

08:19.124 --> 08:21.459
- Kid, buy me some time.
- Hold on, Oz.

08:21.459 --> 08:23.753
What if she asks me
about her brother? Or Castillo?

08:23.753 --> 08:25.880
Just tell her you had a hand
in killing 'em both.

08:25.880 --> 08:27.257
See what happens.

08:27.924 --> 08:29.509
I'm fucking with you.
She's a pussycat.

08:29.509 --> 08:31.219
She is the Hangman.

08:31.219 --> 08:33.555
Don't believe everything
you read in the papers.

08:34.055 --> 08:35.306
Hey, Sal.

08:35.306 --> 08:38.476
Man of the hour,
I was just thinkin' about you...

08:42.063 --> 08:44.941
Did Nadia tell ya about
that shit I got on Johnny Viti?

08:44.941 --> 08:46.818
Yeah, I'm tryin'
to set something up,

08:46.818 --> 08:48.737
but the Family's on lockdown.

08:53.241 --> 08:54.534
Shit.

09:03.835 --> 09:05.670
- Where's Oz?
- He's...

09:05.670 --> 09:08.089
He's just-- He's getting
dressed right now.

09:08.089 --> 09:09.007
Yup.

09:10.425 --> 09:11.384
Welcome.

09:24.022 --> 09:25.774
That's...
That's the remote for...

09:27.942 --> 09:28.985
Yeah.

09:30.570 --> 09:31.571
Tacky.

09:33.406 --> 09:36.493
Would you--
Do you wanna s-sit down?

09:36.493 --> 09:37.786
I'd rather not.

09:43.333 --> 09:45.043
So, where'd Oz find you?

09:46.836 --> 09:48.296
I...

09:48.296 --> 09:51.007
did some... work.

09:51.007 --> 09:54.803
I worked on one of his cars.

09:54.803 --> 09:56.304
I mean, I worked on his car.

09:56.304 --> 10:00.767
He thought that I-I did... good,

10:00.767 --> 10:03.436
and so he... hired me

10:03.436 --> 10:04.646
as his driver.

10:05.397 --> 10:06.648
You're a mechanic?

10:08.191 --> 10:10.527
Yeah. Kind of, yes.

10:10.527 --> 10:13.238
I... I sort of...

10:19.577 --> 10:21.746
Then why can't you work
a lighter?

10:22.372 --> 10:23.832
I think this thing's
broken actually.

10:33.299 --> 10:34.342
That's good.

10:37.679 --> 10:38.680
What's your name?

10:39.431 --> 10:41.933
It's Vi... Victor.

10:44.102 --> 10:46.855
Victor, the young mechanic.

10:48.606 --> 10:51.026
Oz used to be my driver.
Did he tell you that?

10:53.820 --> 10:54.863
I didn't think so.

10:58.408 --> 10:59.451
There she is.

11:00.368 --> 11:02.454
- What'd I miss?
- I like your place.

11:03.121 --> 11:04.080
Thank you.

11:05.040 --> 11:06.166
Understated.

11:08.710 --> 11:09.794
Let's go.

11:13.131 --> 11:14.758
- Hey, ready?
- Mm-hmm.

11:16.718 --> 11:17.635
Just us.

11:18.678 --> 11:20.638
Sorry, Victor.
It's gonna be a long night.

11:21.681 --> 11:23.350
I thought we was just
picking up a shipment.

11:23.350 --> 11:25.226
It's something like that.

11:27.896 --> 11:28.938
Come on.

11:28.938 --> 11:30.148
You're driving.

11:30.648 --> 11:31.900
Just like old times.

11:35.236 --> 11:36.154
Stay put.

11:40.325 --> 11:42.160
You do anything stupid,
I'll sense it.

11:56.591 --> 11:57.509
Victor?

11:57.509 --> 11:59.135
- Hi.
- Where've you been?

12:19.906 --> 12:20.990
Always a gentleman.

12:23.743 --> 12:25.203
Wanna tell me
what's going on here?

12:26.204 --> 12:27.872
I thought Alberto
told you everything.

12:27.872 --> 12:30.750
Well, Al wasn't exactly
a detail-oriented guy, you know?

12:30.750 --> 12:33.003
- Marco.
- He told me he had big plans

12:33.003 --> 12:34.713
and he needed my help
with distro.

12:36.381 --> 12:37.966
How many more we got left?

12:38.842 --> 12:39.801
As promised.

12:40.552 --> 12:42.929
Perfect clarity. Untraceable.

12:45.223 --> 12:46.433
Looks good, Ms. Falcone.

12:52.313 --> 12:53.440
- This it?
- We got more.

12:53.440 --> 12:54.983
Sorry about your brother.

12:54.983 --> 12:56.443
Tell your men to be careful.

12:57.777 --> 12:58.945
Come on, let's go.

12:58.945 --> 12:59.863
Hey.

13:01.614 --> 13:03.950
This shit... came from Arkham?

13:05.076 --> 13:07.162
I thought
this was all Al's plan.

13:08.872 --> 13:09.998
I know you did.

13:19.549 --> 13:22.010
Oz, meet Trey Bloom,
our chemist.

13:24.054 --> 13:25.305
Welcome, brother.

13:29.976 --> 13:31.811
The fuck you cookin' in here?

13:34.272 --> 13:35.231
This way.

13:40.195 --> 13:41.321
Gorgeous product.

13:41.321 --> 13:44.199
And this substrate is making
them fruit like wildfire.

13:51.456 --> 13:52.749
Mushrooms?

13:56.336 --> 13:57.462
Don't!

13:58.213 --> 13:59.631
They're extremely fragile.

14:00.507 --> 14:02.300
Any change
in the moisture or temperature

14:02.300 --> 14:03.968
could wipe out
the entire colony.

14:03.968 --> 14:05.595
Oh yeah? The whole colony, huh?

14:05.595 --> 14:07.847
Fuckin' great. Hey, listen.

14:08.515 --> 14:09.974
I know you been gone a while.

14:10.850 --> 14:13.186
You can buy shrooms
in any dorm room in Gotham.

14:13.728 --> 14:16.981
It's not exactly
what I'd call revolutionary.

14:18.608 --> 14:20.735
You have
a very limited imagination.

14:22.946 --> 14:23.988
Come here.

14:29.953 --> 14:31.663
It's not the mushrooms
that we're using.

14:32.956 --> 14:34.749
They're the basidiospores.

14:35.750 --> 14:36.835
The fuck d'you just say to me?

14:37.460 --> 14:41.047
These are bleeding tooth fungi,
a rare strain.

14:41.047 --> 14:43.216
The psychoactive compound
in the sap

14:43.216 --> 14:45.885
creates a potent,
euphoric stimulant.

14:45.885 --> 14:47.429
It's a completely
different high.

14:49.681 --> 14:51.057
So it's a party drug.

14:54.019 --> 14:54.978
Sure.

14:54.978 --> 14:56.021
I suppose.

14:58.231 --> 15:00.859
And you took this shit
in Arkham?

15:03.278 --> 15:04.738
We have a small
test batch ready,

15:04.738 --> 15:06.197
and after tonight,

15:06.197 --> 15:09.200
we're going to have
a hell of a lot more.

15:09.200 --> 15:12.203
Sure, but you can't use
your Family's connects on this.

15:12.203 --> 15:14.748
You know,
not without Luca gettin' wind.

15:15.707 --> 15:16.833
That's why you're here.

15:17.375 --> 15:19.044
You seem to know
everybody's business in town.

15:19.627 --> 15:21.463
So, now's your time
to shine, Oz.

15:22.839 --> 15:25.216
Find me a distributor,
and we'll paint the town red.

15:35.685 --> 15:36.936
- Hey.
- Hi.

15:36.936 --> 15:39.981
- Sorry I didn't call you sooner.
- I'm just glad you're safe.

15:44.652 --> 15:46.571
Calvin's not with you, is he?

15:47.572 --> 15:49.532
He disappeared
around the same time you did.

15:49.532 --> 15:50.867
I thought maybe...

15:51.951 --> 15:54.162
No, no. I-I haven't seen him.

15:55.246 --> 15:56.247
Thanks.

16:00.085 --> 16:02.295
So, you just drive
this club owner around,

16:02.295 --> 16:03.630
and he lets you stay here?

16:05.882 --> 16:07.175
Pretty much, yeah.

16:09.552 --> 16:11.680
Shit. Sorry. Hang on.

16:11.680 --> 16:14.683
I-I... It's... You know.

16:14.683 --> 16:15.892
- It's okay.
- Okay.

16:15.892 --> 16:17.143
- I get it.
- Good.

16:19.062 --> 16:20.647
Yo, this place is bougie.

16:22.065 --> 16:23.149
It is.

16:24.693 --> 16:25.819
And you are too now.

16:25.819 --> 16:27.028
- I'm bougie?
- Mm-mmm.

16:32.534 --> 16:33.743
You look good.

16:35.120 --> 16:36.246
I missed you.

16:40.875 --> 16:42.252
I'm leaving, Victor.

16:43.795 --> 16:45.714
I'm going to California.

16:45.714 --> 16:48.717
Wh-Why?

16:48.717 --> 16:51.678
Why-Why... would you do that?

16:52.887 --> 16:54.472
'Cause our school is underwater,

16:54.472 --> 16:57.183
and I don't wanna live
in a FEMA camp anymore.

16:58.018 --> 16:59.477
Yeah, but your-- you...

17:00.353 --> 17:01.479
I mean...

17:02.522 --> 17:05.525
your-your-your life is here.

17:06.818 --> 17:08.111
Not anymore.

17:11.114 --> 17:12.574
Our families are dead.

17:14.701 --> 17:16.619
We gotta take care
of ourselves now.

17:17.829 --> 17:18.872
When?

17:20.165 --> 17:23.293
When-When are you going?

17:24.502 --> 17:25.837
Tomorrow night.

17:26.588 --> 17:28.923
- Alright.
- I'm taking a bus out.

17:34.262 --> 17:35.764
You hungry? I...

17:35.764 --> 17:36.973
I got us...

17:38.224 --> 17:40.643
pizza if you want a--
if you want a slice.

17:44.022 --> 17:45.148
Victor.

17:47.108 --> 17:48.151
Hey.

17:50.070 --> 17:51.780
You've got a good thing
going here.

17:51.780 --> 17:53.490
I'm really happy for you.

17:54.657 --> 17:55.658
'Cause, like...

17:56.826 --> 17:58.787
this is what you want. Right?

18:04.542 --> 18:05.502
'Cause...

18:06.586 --> 18:08.672
you-you could come with me.

18:10.507 --> 18:12.050
We could start over.

18:12.884 --> 18:14.052
Really?

18:14.052 --> 18:15.095
Yeah.

18:20.475 --> 18:21.643
I don't-- I don't...

18:22.602 --> 18:23.770
I don't...

18:24.396 --> 18:25.647
I'm not sure that...

18:27.816 --> 18:29.234
I'm not sure
that he'd let me go.

18:29.943 --> 18:31.194
Who? Your boss?

18:33.321 --> 18:34.489
Why would he care?

18:38.201 --> 18:40.870
He's not just like a...
a club owner.

18:40.870 --> 18:41.830
He's...

18:46.710 --> 18:48.169
He's like a gangster.

18:51.756 --> 18:54.259
If I took off,
I don't think that...

18:55.677 --> 18:57.262
It's weird. It's like...

18:58.680 --> 19:00.682
He kind of likes
having me around.

19:01.641 --> 19:03.476
He's kinda... he's kinda lonely.

19:04.936 --> 19:06.730
And I've seen stuff.

19:06.730 --> 19:08.898
You know, stuff
that I-I shouldn't have,

19:08.898 --> 19:11.609
so if left, I don't know

19:12.736 --> 19:14.320
what he would do.

19:14.320 --> 19:17.949
Then... you definitely
shouldn't stay.

19:20.535 --> 19:21.703
I mean, nothing good can come

19:21.703 --> 19:23.079
from working
for a guy like that.

19:25.248 --> 19:26.666
That is not who you are.

19:31.671 --> 19:33.006
You sound like my dad.

19:35.550 --> 19:36.593
Sorry.

19:36.593 --> 19:37.886
No, no.

19:40.221 --> 19:41.389
It's not a bad thing.

19:44.559 --> 19:45.393
Oh, no.

19:47.270 --> 19:48.229
Shit.

19:49.522 --> 19:51.941
He... He's on his way back,
so you gotta go.

19:51.941 --> 19:53.193
- What?
- Yeah.

19:53.985 --> 19:55.111
Wait.

19:57.572 --> 19:59.240
- Here. Take this.
- Whoa, that's--

19:59.240 --> 20:00.492
No, no, listen.

20:02.243 --> 20:03.578
Stay somewhere nice.

20:04.954 --> 20:06.831
- And get me a ticket.
- Really?

20:06.831 --> 20:08.875
Yeah. I'm gonna meet you
at Gotham Station.

20:08.875 --> 20:09.751
- Okay.
- Okay.

20:09.751 --> 20:12.295
Are you gonna tell
your boss, or...?

20:12.295 --> 20:13.922
I'm gonna figure that out.

20:24.933 --> 20:26.351
- Okay.
- Okay.

20:26.351 --> 20:27.769
- I'll text you.
- Okay.

20:27.769 --> 20:29.479
- Okay.
- Alright.

20:44.536 --> 20:45.704
Sofia.

20:51.042 --> 20:52.419
Where you been?

20:52.419 --> 20:53.753
What's with all the muscle?

20:54.337 --> 20:55.672
And all the cars outside?

20:55.672 --> 20:58.216
We all gotta lay low
until shit dies down.

20:58.216 --> 20:59.467
That's your grand plan?

20:59.467 --> 21:01.261
Our men are being gunned down

21:01.261 --> 21:03.430
by the Maronis
in broad daylight, but...

21:04.973 --> 21:06.683
you're throwing
a fuckin' sleepover.

21:07.434 --> 21:09.436
This business
ain't your business.

21:10.020 --> 21:11.479
Take a fuckin' hint.

21:12.355 --> 21:15.275
Luca, he's the head
of the Family now.

21:16.401 --> 21:19.529
Okay? So, when he tells you
to go to Italy,

21:20.238 --> 21:21.781
you get on a fucking plane.

21:27.287 --> 21:28.872
Did you print this out yourself?

21:30.999 --> 21:32.751
Look, honey,

21:33.626 --> 21:35.211
I know you're not right
in the head.

21:35.211 --> 21:36.921
I mean, that's
pretty damn clear.

21:38.423 --> 21:39.924
But I'm not scared of you.

21:41.885 --> 21:44.637
All I see is a spoiled brat
who got what she deserved.

21:51.227 --> 21:52.479
Thank you.

21:55.482 --> 21:56.733
I appreciate this.

21:58.693 --> 22:00.737
- I just need some time to get--
- Two days.

22:02.280 --> 22:03.448
Then you go to Italy.

22:07.077 --> 22:09.037
Or I tell people
that's where you went.

22:22.509 --> 22:23.802
Vic, grab the case.

22:26.137 --> 22:27.138
Chop chop!

22:33.353 --> 22:34.437
Chinatown, huh?

22:37.649 --> 22:40.068
You're aware my father pushed
the Triads out of the drug game?

22:40.068 --> 22:41.528
Yeah, I was there, doll.

22:41.528 --> 22:43.321
But we need someone
who ain't gonna rat us out

22:43.321 --> 22:45.073
as soon as we tell 'em
our plan, you know?

22:45.073 --> 22:46.574
Come on. There it is.

22:47.951 --> 22:49.160
What's all this?

22:49.160 --> 22:51.579
Little hospitality gift
for my pal Link Tsai.

22:51.579 --> 22:53.498
A Triad deputy
who runs their clubs.

22:53.498 --> 22:54.874
We're friendly.

22:54.874 --> 22:56.793
Why are we wasting our time
with a deputy?

22:57.794 --> 22:59.587
Feng Zhao is the Dai Lo,

22:59.587 --> 23:01.548
the only person that
can authorize a partnership.

23:01.548 --> 23:03.758
We don't got a relationship
with Feng Zhao, do we?

23:04.551 --> 23:06.052
You got me, I got Link.

23:06.553 --> 23:08.054
Kid, keep your eye on the bag.

23:09.639 --> 23:10.640
Hey.

23:10.640 --> 23:11.891
We're closed.

23:13.518 --> 23:14.561
How ya doin'?

23:15.186 --> 23:16.229
I'm Oz.

23:16.896 --> 23:18.606
We're here to see Link Tsai.

23:24.446 --> 23:25.488
There you go.

23:25.488 --> 23:26.698
Got it?

23:31.494 --> 23:32.746
It's in the back.

23:36.750 --> 23:38.001
Didn't know you were carrying.

23:38.001 --> 23:39.627
Well, I figured you were, so...

23:39.627 --> 23:41.171
Oh, this is unreal.

23:42.464 --> 23:43.548
Maybe next time, call ahead.

23:43.548 --> 23:46.051
Sometimes it's better
to ask for forgiveness.

23:46.051 --> 23:48.136
I told you not to show your face
till you had my money.

23:48.136 --> 23:51.306
Link, brought you some top-shelf
from the 44.

23:51.306 --> 23:52.349
My best shit.

23:53.391 --> 23:54.476
You think I give a fuck?

23:55.101 --> 23:56.978
I sent you a whole truck
of cigarettes.

23:57.812 --> 23:58.646
Where's my cut?

23:58.646 --> 24:00.732
You think I'd come here
empty-handed?

24:00.732 --> 24:03.193
Come on, we both know that
if I ever truly left you hangin'

24:03.193 --> 24:05.111
there'd be a bullet
between my eyes.

24:05.111 --> 24:07.489
I got a real opportunity
for you here,

24:07.489 --> 24:10.325
but it's kinda hard to focus
with a gun pointed at my face.

24:19.334 --> 24:20.543
Sofia Falcone.

24:21.294 --> 24:23.588
We've never met,
but I know who you are.

24:23.588 --> 24:24.756
Good for you.

24:27.592 --> 24:30.470
This... is why we're here.

24:30.470 --> 24:31.429
We're calling it...

24:33.014 --> 24:33.932
Bliss.

24:44.150 --> 24:45.110
Hey, Oz...

24:46.986 --> 24:48.029
So...

24:49.239 --> 24:51.574
there's this girl, and...

24:52.158 --> 24:54.577
she means a lot to me.

24:55.495 --> 24:56.955
And-And you do too.

24:57.789 --> 24:59.624
You know I'm not a rat. Right?

24:59.624 --> 25:01.084
You know I'd never...

25:01.084 --> 25:04.379
If I... If I ever saw
anything...

25:05.588 --> 25:07.173
I would never say anything...

25:11.594 --> 25:12.929
He's gonna kill me.

25:13.513 --> 25:14.764
He's gonna kill me.

25:25.442 --> 25:26.443
Shit.

25:45.879 --> 25:47.213
Step out of the car, son.

25:52.010 --> 25:53.303
What...

25:53.303 --> 25:55.263
W-W...

25:56.598 --> 25:59.434
Wha... W-What did I do?

25:59.434 --> 26:00.560
You nervous?

26:00.560 --> 26:02.062
No, I just-just...

26:02.062 --> 26:04.022
I-I s--

26:04.022 --> 26:06.524
s-s-stutter sometimes.

26:06.524 --> 26:08.401
You're idling in a loading zone.
Turn around.

26:09.361 --> 26:11.112
- I can just move the--
- Turn around.

26:11.112 --> 26:12.280
Hands on the hood.

26:15.992 --> 26:17.327
Is this your car?

26:18.119 --> 26:20.455
- It's my boss's car.
- Pretty flashy.

26:25.460 --> 26:27.462
That's a lot of money for a kid
to be carrying around.

26:35.095 --> 26:37.013
I don't know w-what
you're talking about.

26:37.013 --> 26:38.598
I don't have any money.

26:41.768 --> 26:42.727
Guess not.

26:45.105 --> 26:47.565
Soon as your boss is back,
get outta here.

26:53.822 --> 26:55.323
No fucking way.

26:56.700 --> 26:59.786
You seriously trying
to sell me on a... a coup?

26:59.786 --> 27:03.665
The two of you are gonna
take over the Falcone Family

27:03.665 --> 27:05.041
in the middle of a gang war?

27:05.041 --> 27:06.251
A coup?

27:07.961 --> 27:09.754
What are you,
readin' books or something?

27:10.422 --> 27:13.341
No, what we got goin' is
more of a corporate restructure.

27:13.341 --> 27:14.342
Mm-hmm.

27:16.594 --> 27:18.263
And we ain't goin' at it alone.

27:19.431 --> 27:22.350
We got support
from within the Family.

27:23.518 --> 27:24.769
- You do?
- 'Course.

27:24.769 --> 27:26.855
You think we'd walk in here
without our shit on lock?

27:26.855 --> 27:27.856
Come on.

27:27.856 --> 27:28.857
Who?

27:30.442 --> 27:32.444
- Who?
- Yeah, who?

27:37.115 --> 27:38.033
Johnny Viti.

27:41.369 --> 27:43.496
- That's bullshit.
- Fuck you, bullshit.

27:43.496 --> 27:46.124
Luca Falcone's underboss
is backing you?

27:46.124 --> 27:47.417
He's backing me.

27:48.501 --> 27:50.003
Johnny is my mother's cousin.

27:50.587 --> 27:52.255
He and I are very close.

27:52.881 --> 27:56.176
He also knows
that Bliss is a game changer.

27:56.176 --> 27:58.261
- Uh-huh.
- And that Luca...

27:59.346 --> 28:00.805
doesn't have the balls
to see it through.

28:00.805 --> 28:01.723
That's true.

28:01.723 --> 28:05.518
I mean, look at how he
mishandled our Drops operation.

28:05.518 --> 28:07.228
- Disaster.
- Embarrassing.

28:07.228 --> 28:10.315
- Yeah, that's right.
- Zhao's gonna need proof.

28:10.315 --> 28:12.650
What does he want,
a letter of recommendation?

28:12.650 --> 28:14.402
A phone call would suffice.

28:14.986 --> 28:17.614
From Johnny Viti, directly.

28:18.865 --> 28:20.367
Or are you full of shit
as usual, Oz?

28:20.367 --> 28:21.910
Nah, my word's good.

28:23.328 --> 28:24.913
But since your face
don't seem to agree...

28:27.332 --> 28:29.250
I'll have Viti give
the old man a ring,

28:29.250 --> 28:30.835
let him know
we're all pals here.

28:30.835 --> 28:31.878
And once he does,

28:31.878 --> 28:34.506
you're gonna get us an audience
with Mr. Zhao.

28:34.506 --> 28:36.049
And you're gonna do it tonight.

28:36.049 --> 28:37.342
Right here.

28:37.342 --> 28:39.177
We'll set up a trial run
for the drug.

28:39.177 --> 28:41.429
And when it all goes off
without a hitch,

28:41.429 --> 28:44.140
we'll, you know,
get you a fair price.

28:44.140 --> 28:45.350
That's right.

28:47.310 --> 28:50.188
I always knew it was a matter of
time before you made a move, Oz.

28:51.815 --> 28:53.108
Didn't think
it would come like this.

28:55.151 --> 28:57.195
Assuming that you hold up
your end,

28:59.072 --> 29:00.907
I'll get you a sit-down
with the Dai Lo.

29:03.034 --> 29:04.035
After that,

29:05.870 --> 29:06.746
it's outta my hands.

29:13.169 --> 29:14.337
There it is.

29:15.505 --> 29:18.717
What aren't you telling me
about Johnny Viti?

29:19.634 --> 29:21.803
Look at you.
You're havin' fun, I can tell.

29:21.803 --> 29:23.930
Oz. I don't-- Oz.

29:23.930 --> 29:26.391
Alright, listen. Jesus.
I got a plan.

29:26.391 --> 29:28.852
Okay? You're just gonna
have to trust me.

29:36.317 --> 29:37.318
You musta pissed yourself.

29:37.318 --> 29:39.070
So then what?
Cop finds your money...?

29:39.070 --> 29:43.033
Right, so he-he finds my money,
and I said...

29:43.033 --> 29:46.953
I said... I go,
"I don't have any money."

29:47.579 --> 29:49.914
And he just took it.

29:49.914 --> 29:51.875
He took the whole fuckin' G?

29:52.834 --> 29:54.252
The motherfucker!

29:54.252 --> 29:57.005
Well, that's the cost
of doin' business, kid.

29:57.005 --> 29:57.922
Welcome to the life!

30:12.604 --> 30:14.105
- So, Oz--
- Have we made any decisions?

30:14.105 --> 30:15.982
I'll take the coq au vin.
Do that again.

30:15.982 --> 30:17.942
- Vic?
- Right.

30:17.942 --> 30:22.280
I'll do the...
the-the steak f-f...

30:23.531 --> 30:26.368
The steak f...

30:28.411 --> 30:29.662
Steak f-f--

30:29.662 --> 30:31.456
- Steak frites.
- Hey.

30:31.456 --> 30:32.832
Don't do that.

30:32.832 --> 30:34.918
The man was speakin'.
Let him finish.

30:35.960 --> 30:37.128
I apologize.

30:37.128 --> 30:38.380
Please.

30:38.380 --> 30:39.798
Yeah, no, the...

30:42.634 --> 30:43.718
steak f...

30:46.554 --> 30:48.306
...frites. Steak frites, thanks.

30:49.307 --> 30:50.350
Right away, sir.

30:53.019 --> 30:55.105
"Sir."
He's trying to save his tip.

30:55.105 --> 30:56.856
You know,
you don't gotta do that.

30:56.856 --> 30:58.775
Yeah, I know. You should do it.

30:59.651 --> 31:01.111
Fuck what they think.

31:01.111 --> 31:02.445
Let 'em wait.

31:02.445 --> 31:04.489
You know, take up space.

31:04.489 --> 31:05.657
You got fight in you, Vic.

31:05.657 --> 31:07.283
You gotta let it out.

31:11.955 --> 31:13.123
What did your...

31:15.208 --> 31:16.501
What'd your parents do?

31:17.460 --> 31:18.920
What line of work were they in?

31:21.881 --> 31:23.299
Well, my mom,

31:24.718 --> 31:27.929
she was a... a home health aide.

31:27.929 --> 31:29.514
- Yeah?
- And...

31:30.265 --> 31:32.726
my dad, he was a mechanic.

31:32.726 --> 31:33.810
Okay.

31:33.810 --> 31:36.604
But in... in his heart,

31:37.522 --> 31:39.107
- the man was a chef.
- Chef?

31:39.107 --> 31:40.442
Yeah, loved to cook.

31:40.442 --> 31:41.735
- Is that right?
- Yeah.

31:41.735 --> 31:45.280
It was mostly M-Mexican
and Dominican stuff.

31:45.280 --> 31:49.200
- Yeah, yeah.
- Like carnitas and sancocho...

31:49.200 --> 31:50.410
- Things like that.
- Beautiful.

31:50.410 --> 31:53.371
Yeah, yeah. But, man, I mean,

31:53.371 --> 31:55.206
he would've got
a kick out of this place too.

31:55.206 --> 31:59.878
The-The s-snails
and-and the oysters...

31:59.878 --> 32:02.422
You know, it's... it's nice.

32:02.422 --> 32:04.257
And I-I don't think...

32:04.257 --> 32:08.595
I don't think he ever got to eat
in a lot of n-nice restaurants.

32:11.056 --> 32:12.223
That ain't right.

32:13.433 --> 32:14.976
That ain't fucking right.

32:17.145 --> 32:19.773
Look... Fuck.

32:19.773 --> 32:22.275
The world ain't set up
for the honest man to succeed.

32:23.193 --> 32:24.361
Mechanic's a good job.

32:24.361 --> 32:26.571
That should be
the American dream right there.

32:26.571 --> 32:28.948
You know, a beautiful story
with a happy ending.

32:31.034 --> 32:33.370
But that ain't the way
the world works, Vic.

32:35.288 --> 32:36.414
America's a hustle.

32:39.876 --> 32:41.169
What was his name?

32:44.547 --> 32:45.674
Juan.

32:47.842 --> 32:49.302
Juan Ramon Aguilar.

32:50.887 --> 32:54.057
To Juan Ramon Aguilar.

32:57.477 --> 32:58.728
He raised a good son.

33:03.858 --> 33:05.610
Your dad would be
proud of you, Vic.

33:16.496 --> 33:17.956
All right. It's go time.

33:27.799 --> 33:29.050
Hiya, Tina.

33:29.634 --> 33:31.928
Oz. What are you doing here?

33:31.928 --> 33:33.179
I need a favor.

33:34.681 --> 33:35.807
It's gonna sting.

33:44.024 --> 33:45.567
Took ya long enough.

33:45.567 --> 33:46.943
Afraid he'll finish early?

33:57.287 --> 33:58.621
Congratulations on the nuptials.

34:00.165 --> 34:01.791
What the fuck?

34:03.084 --> 34:03.960
Get out.

34:05.378 --> 34:07.130
How's the fuckin' going, Johnny?

34:09.007 --> 34:10.175
Tina.

34:10.175 --> 34:11.760
Don't forget your panties.

34:18.016 --> 34:19.559
One word about this to Luca,
I swear--

34:19.559 --> 34:21.728
And what, Johnny?
What're you gonna do?

34:21.728 --> 34:23.188
Your ghost will haunt me?

34:24.105 --> 34:25.940
I gotta say,
fuckin' the Boss's wife?

34:25.940 --> 34:27.525
I mean, that's bush-league.

34:27.525 --> 34:30.195
So what? Are you two
working together now?

34:30.779 --> 34:32.072
Oz is working for me.

34:32.906 --> 34:34.282
Are you fucking serious?

34:34.282 --> 34:36.326
You're going against Luca
to back a psychopath?

34:36.326 --> 34:38.828
You're gonna back her too, Viti.
That's why we're here.

34:39.454 --> 34:40.705
And I don't think
she appreciates

34:40.705 --> 34:41.790
you calling her a psycho.

34:41.790 --> 34:43.500
He's absolutely right. I don't.

34:43.625 --> 34:45.001
Here's what's gonna happen.

34:47.671 --> 34:51.424
You are gonna get Feng Zhao
on the line.

34:51.424 --> 34:54.302
You're gonna tell him that
you sat down with me and Sofia,

34:54.302 --> 34:56.096
and that we got your support.

34:56.096 --> 34:57.472
- Sound good?
- Are you fuckin' nuts?

34:57.472 --> 34:59.182
You want me to lie
to the head of the Triads?

34:59.182 --> 35:00.308
Doesn't have to be a lie,

35:00.308 --> 35:02.352
dependin' on which way
you wanna play it.

35:02.852 --> 35:04.688
We could all get rid
of Luca together, right?

35:04.688 --> 35:06.439
- That's right.
- Think about it. I get rich.

35:06.439 --> 35:07.816
Sofia gets the Family.

35:07.816 --> 35:09.150
You get to fuck
Tina's brains out

35:09.150 --> 35:10.652
on a beach with white sand
somewhere.

35:10.652 --> 35:13.780
- Sounds pretty good.
- Don't it? What do you say?

35:13.780 --> 35:16.741
Sofia, I thought you knew better
than to trust this asshole.

35:17.492 --> 35:18.785
Especially after
what he did to you.

35:18.785 --> 35:20.203
What I did to her?

35:20.203 --> 35:21.913
Fuck you--
Shut the fuck up, Johnny.

35:21.913 --> 35:25.542
After you got locked up,
Carmine let him run the 44,

35:26.126 --> 35:27.794
but he never respected him.

35:29.587 --> 35:31.381
And I bet you don't respect him
either, do you?

35:34.509 --> 35:36.678
You're fun at a card game
or over drinks.

35:36.678 --> 35:37.887
I'll give you that.

35:37.887 --> 35:40.598
But people don't keep you around
because they think you're smart.

35:40.598 --> 35:42.976
And they sure as shit
don't trust you.

35:43.727 --> 35:44.561
Nah...

35:45.103 --> 35:48.273
People keep the Penguin around
as entertainment,

35:48.273 --> 35:51.109
because everybody knows
you're a goddamn joke.

35:51.109 --> 35:52.360
You fuck!

35:56.239 --> 35:59.325
This fuckin' funny to you, huh?
You scumbag!

36:00.076 --> 36:03.955
You and the Family,
hangin' Sofia out to dry, huh?

36:04.581 --> 36:08.460
You lowlife,
two-timin' fuckin' coward, Viti.

36:20.680 --> 36:21.514
Here.

36:24.517 --> 36:26.394
Make the fucking call.

36:37.238 --> 36:38.490
Alright, listen up.

36:38.490 --> 36:41.242
Tonight we're bringin'
something new

36:41.242 --> 36:43.036
to the good people of Gotham.

36:43.036 --> 36:45.330
It's a party drug called Bliss.

36:45.955 --> 36:47.832
That's why I asked
you ladies here.

36:47.957 --> 36:49.709
You're the best fuckin'
salespeople I know.

36:50.585 --> 36:52.462
We're gonna start at 20 a hit.

36:52.462 --> 36:55.465
Vic here is gonna be our bagman
for the night.

36:55.465 --> 36:58.426
So if any of you ladies need
to re-up, you go to him.

36:58.426 --> 36:59.844
He'll take your cash,

36:59.844 --> 37:01.680
and I'll get you back
before last call. Alright?

37:01.680 --> 37:04.516
- Alright, cool.
- Security knows who you are.

37:04.516 --> 37:06.893
Any trouble, you go straight
to them. Understood?

37:07.686 --> 37:09.562
Get out there and make us
a fuck ton of money.

37:10.897 --> 37:12.816
- Go on, do your thing!
- Let's go, girls!

37:12.816 --> 37:14.150
We on it, baby!

37:18.947 --> 37:20.198
Hey, kid.

37:20.198 --> 37:22.784
Remember, alright?
They want what you got.

37:22.784 --> 37:24.202
Not the other way around.

37:24.202 --> 37:26.621
Shoulders back.
Take up space, okay?

37:27.789 --> 37:29.165
Hey, hey, hey.

37:29.165 --> 37:30.542
Kid...

37:30.542 --> 37:32.544
I wouldn't ask you to do this

37:32.544 --> 37:34.337
if I didn't know
you could handle it.

37:36.172 --> 37:37.465
I believe in you, kid.

37:38.883 --> 37:40.218
- Got it?
- Mm-hmm.

37:41.219 --> 37:42.387
Get outta here.

37:45.515 --> 37:47.308
- Where you going?
- Powder my nose.

37:47.308 --> 37:48.518
Yeah?

37:56.484 --> 37:57.569
Inspiring speech.

37:57.569 --> 37:58.570
Thank you.

37:59.362 --> 38:01.698
- Think it will do the trick?
- Fuckin' hope so.

38:02.574 --> 38:05.577
Feng Zhao will be here soon.
Hope he likes what he sees.

38:07.537 --> 38:08.830
We're gonna be untouchable.

38:12.834 --> 38:14.419
I can't tell
who wants this more.

38:15.211 --> 38:16.046
Me or you.

38:18.340 --> 38:19.466
I want this for you.

38:21.259 --> 38:23.636
You say all the right things,
don't you, Oz?

38:25.597 --> 38:27.724
Listen, Zhao's gonna wanna see
that we're serious,

38:27.724 --> 38:28.641
that we're a team.

38:28.641 --> 38:30.060
Was it worth it?

38:30.060 --> 38:31.061
What's that?

38:31.728 --> 38:32.937
What you did to me.

38:34.230 --> 38:35.565
Was it worth it?

38:36.316 --> 38:38.360
Did you get everything
that you wanted?

38:39.069 --> 38:42.072
'Cause it seems like you just--
you-you want more.

38:42.072 --> 38:43.448
Who's talkin' here?

38:44.074 --> 38:45.033
You or Johnny Viti?

38:45.033 --> 38:47.327
He's got you eatin' outta
his hand. You know that, right?

38:47.327 --> 38:49.079
He didn't say anything
I don't already know.

38:49.079 --> 38:50.372
Come on!

38:50.372 --> 38:52.457
We're so close to gettin'
what you want. Let's not--

38:52.457 --> 38:53.750
I asked you a question.

38:53.875 --> 38:56.294
Jesus!
It's been ten fuckin' years!

38:56.294 --> 38:57.462
I know how long it's been,

38:57.462 --> 39:00.507
and I am not some ignorant kid
that you can play with anymore.

39:00.507 --> 39:02.801
- That ain't what I'm--
- Zhao is here to see me.

39:04.427 --> 39:05.762
Not my former driver.

39:08.264 --> 39:09.099
Remember that.

39:28.868 --> 39:30.745
Hey! Vicky!

39:31.454 --> 39:32.872
I need more.

39:32.872 --> 39:33.957
How much?

39:34.457 --> 39:35.500
More!

39:38.962 --> 39:39.879
Here you go.

39:49.597 --> 39:50.932
Got something for you.

39:51.766 --> 39:53.685
For the boys at the table.

39:57.439 --> 39:59.649
Yo, you the man with the shit?

39:59.649 --> 40:02.110
- Yup, that's me.
- It's good shit, man.

40:02.110 --> 40:03.611
We gave your girl 200.

40:04.362 --> 40:05.447
Here you go.

40:10.618 --> 40:12.412
There is no better feeling,

40:12.412 --> 40:14.039
and there's
nothing else like it.

40:14.039 --> 40:16.166
People can see that.
They can feel it.

40:16.750 --> 40:19.002
And that translates
into dollars, Mr. Zhao.

40:19.002 --> 40:21.087
We've raised the price
twice already, right?

40:21.087 --> 40:22.255
It hasn't affected sales.

40:22.797 --> 40:24.549
We're projectin' sixty a hit.

40:24.549 --> 40:27.344
Sixty a fuckin' hit?
On the first night?

40:27.344 --> 40:28.803
It's unheard of.

40:28.803 --> 40:30.305
Imagine the future.

40:30.305 --> 40:33.183
Our drug,
your clubs, your casinos...

40:33.183 --> 40:34.100
You see it?

40:36.811 --> 40:38.438
There's certainly
a lot of potential

40:38.438 --> 40:40.398
to your plan, Ms. Falcone.

40:41.399 --> 40:42.525
I won't deny that.

40:43.526 --> 40:47.197
But even if you have the support
of the underboss,

40:48.448 --> 40:49.908
the risk here is too great.

40:51.868 --> 40:52.702
Why is that?

40:53.703 --> 40:55.997
The Falcones have a history
with the Triads.

40:55.997 --> 40:58.291
- I'm sure you're aware.
- My father pushed you out.

40:58.291 --> 41:00.293
He relegated you to Chinatown.
I know.

41:02.003 --> 41:05.256
When he died,
I opened a bottle of champagne.

41:05.256 --> 41:08.426
And as soon as I had the chance,
I danced on his grave.

41:09.135 --> 41:11.471
We have more in common
than you might think.

41:13.932 --> 41:15.809
Still... him I knew.

41:16.351 --> 41:17.477
But you...

41:19.020 --> 41:21.564
How can I trust you
when I know where you've been?

41:22.440 --> 41:23.983
My time in Arkham
gives you pause.

41:28.446 --> 41:29.906
I appreciate that.

41:31.616 --> 41:33.493
But I'm not the only one
with a past.

41:34.953 --> 41:37.080
I've done some digging
on you, Mr. Zhao.

41:38.123 --> 41:40.750
Before your father was driven
out of Taiwan by the CCP,

41:40.750 --> 41:42.877
he was a psychologist.
Isn't that right?

41:42.877 --> 41:44.671
- It is.
- Then you would agree

41:44.671 --> 41:47.549
that most drug use is rooted
in psychological need?

41:47.549 --> 41:50.343
I would agree
that everything humans do

41:50.343 --> 41:52.137
is rooted in psychological need.

41:53.263 --> 41:56.224
Then I would ask you to examine
this opportunity more closely.

42:01.062 --> 42:02.272
Look at them.

42:04.024 --> 42:06.484
Their city has been decimated.

42:07.861 --> 42:09.654
Our former mayor
was assassinated.

42:11.239 --> 42:13.241
A madman flooded our streets.

42:14.701 --> 42:16.244
People lost their homes...

42:17.370 --> 42:18.580
their families.

42:19.497 --> 42:23.460
The world as they knew it
is gone.

42:24.336 --> 42:26.171
Hey! Bagman!

42:30.508 --> 42:31.926
Come on, let's dance!

42:35.221 --> 42:36.890
I have to get back to work.

42:37.474 --> 42:38.683
Take a break.

42:44.814 --> 42:45.982
Roxy, really.

42:48.818 --> 42:50.195
The show's starting!

43:46.126 --> 43:47.460
Victor...

43:50.213 --> 43:51.381
Victor!

43:53.133 --> 43:54.509
Honey, what is wrong with you?

43:54.509 --> 43:56.261
Shit's everywhere.

43:56.261 --> 43:59.014
- Keep it together. Alright?
- Yeah. Yeah.

43:59.014 --> 44:00.140
Uh-huh.

44:02.976 --> 44:04.853
These people need to escape.

44:05.854 --> 44:08.773
And nothing delivers
a better escape than Bliss.

44:11.276 --> 44:12.902
That's why they gave it to us
in Arkham.

44:17.949 --> 44:21.703
It made us content, submissive.

44:23.079 --> 44:25.165
Any pain that we had
just floated away,

44:26.374 --> 44:28.585
allowing us to forget
where we were.

44:32.672 --> 44:34.424
It's a very powerful drug,

44:35.967 --> 44:38.887
and whoever controls it
will control

44:38.887 --> 44:42.307
the future of the drug trade
in Gotham.

44:49.773 --> 44:51.649
But if you are not interested...

44:53.068 --> 44:54.069
it's fine.

44:55.320 --> 44:57.572
I can go to the Neon Dragons
or the Odessa Mob.

44:57.572 --> 45:01.701
I... I don't much care
who our sales reps are.

45:05.872 --> 45:06.998
What the fuck are you doin'?

45:07.624 --> 45:08.833
He's seen what we have.

45:09.709 --> 45:11.753
Make the deal or don't.
I'll be downstairs.

45:19.511 --> 45:21.513
Come on. Come on.

45:22.889 --> 45:23.765
Calm down.

45:24.432 --> 45:26.726
Calm down. Calm down.

45:28.853 --> 45:29.854
Okay.

45:41.199 --> 45:43.159
There he is.
Been lookin' for ya, kid.

45:43.743 --> 45:45.537
The deal is done.
The Triads are in.

45:45.537 --> 45:47.372
Goddamn, it was sweet!

45:47.997 --> 45:49.874
We're so close
to the finish line, Vic,

45:49.874 --> 45:50.875
but we gotta play it safe.

45:50.875 --> 45:52.711
I still got the Maronis
on my ass.

45:53.336 --> 45:55.380
But you. You're the bagman.

45:55.964 --> 45:57.674
You held your own tonight.

45:57.674 --> 45:59.718
I'm proud of you, Vic.
Proud of you.

46:00.510 --> 46:02.554
Come on. I told Roxy
to order some bottles.

46:02.554 --> 46:03.722
The good stuff.

46:08.727 --> 46:10.103
- Give it to me.
- Oz--

46:10.103 --> 46:11.479
Now, goddammit!

46:17.485 --> 46:18.820
You goin' somewhere?

46:20.363 --> 46:22.157
- With my fuckin' money?
- With the money?

46:22.157 --> 46:23.450
Whoa, no, I wouldn't--

46:23.450 --> 46:25.285
We're this fuckin' close!

46:25.285 --> 46:27.078
And you wanna bail?
For what? A piece of ass?

46:27.078 --> 46:28.455
Oz, it's not her.

46:29.039 --> 46:30.498
All right? It's not her. It's...

46:31.666 --> 46:32.876
It's the f--

46:32.876 --> 46:35.503
- It's the f-f...
- Jesus, kid!

46:35.503 --> 46:37.422
It's everything, alright?
It's everything.

46:37.422 --> 46:39.632
I do everything
that you ask me to do.

46:39.632 --> 46:41.259
Alright? I do it all. I try...

46:41.968 --> 46:43.845
I try to, at least.

46:43.845 --> 46:44.846
It's just...

46:48.516 --> 46:50.977
I-I don't know if I should.

46:50.977 --> 46:53.313
What?
You too good for this life?

46:53.313 --> 46:54.689
Huh? That it?

46:55.774 --> 46:56.941
That's funny, comin' from you.

46:58.610 --> 47:00.820
You wanna go,
what are ya waiting for?

47:00.820 --> 47:01.738
Fuckin' go.

47:03.448 --> 47:05.367
I c-- I can't leave.

47:06.993 --> 47:09.662
The fuck? You think I'm holdin'
you hostage or somethin'?

47:11.831 --> 47:13.291
That what?
You're my fuckin' prisoner?

47:14.584 --> 47:15.460
That it?

47:17.504 --> 47:19.547
- Hey, hey, hey.
- This what it feels like?

47:19.547 --> 47:20.799
- No.
- Being with me?

47:21.591 --> 47:23.510
- What did you have?
- Oz...

47:23.510 --> 47:25.136
Before I found you, huh, kid?

47:25.136 --> 47:26.930
Hey, hey... Please...

47:26.930 --> 47:29.224
Fuckin' nothin', that's what.

47:29.224 --> 47:30.308
A loser.

47:30.308 --> 47:31.851
- I don't--
- A goddamn nobody.

47:31.851 --> 47:34.187
I gave you clothes, money,
a place to crash.

47:34.187 --> 47:37.273
You got all the opportunity
in the world right fuckin' here,

47:37.273 --> 47:38.441
for Christ's sake.

47:39.150 --> 47:40.235
But this.

47:43.238 --> 47:44.572
This is all you feel?

47:46.366 --> 47:48.118
You coulda left
whenever you wanted.

47:49.119 --> 47:50.537
But you chose to stay.

47:51.246 --> 47:52.831
How 'bout you ask yourself why.

47:54.290 --> 47:55.917
- Oz, I don't--
- Nah, let me help.

47:55.917 --> 47:57.043
You stayed

47:57.877 --> 47:59.504
'cause you want
somethin' better.

48:01.172 --> 48:03.008
You want more
than your father ever had.

48:03.008 --> 48:04.175
No.

48:05.468 --> 48:07.387
My dad would be ashamed of me.

48:07.387 --> 48:09.180
You wanna know
what's shameful, Vic?

48:10.557 --> 48:12.142
Workin' your whole goddamn life,

48:12.767 --> 48:14.477
having nothin' to show for it.

48:16.062 --> 48:17.647
You still think
there's good and bad?

48:18.440 --> 48:19.733
Right and wrong?

48:19.733 --> 48:20.775
There ain't.

48:20.775 --> 48:22.027
There's just this.

48:22.819 --> 48:24.237
Survival.

48:24.237 --> 48:25.822
Security. Pleasure.

48:27.949 --> 48:30.201
They don't give out awards
for dying in the projects.

48:30.869 --> 48:31.703
Fuck you.

48:31.703 --> 48:32.746
Fuck me?!

48:33.246 --> 48:35.040
Fuck the goddamn world!

48:35.040 --> 48:38.001
They don't give a shit about you
or your family.

48:39.794 --> 48:41.921
You think you're nothin',
you are nothin'.

48:41.921 --> 48:44.341
Till the day you die.
I thought you were smart.

48:44.341 --> 48:46.092
But that's the life you want,
guess what, Vic?

48:46.092 --> 48:48.011
Good news. You already got it.

48:51.806 --> 48:53.350
So go, get the fuck outta here.

48:54.142 --> 48:55.310
You don't deserve this.

51:17.118 --> 51:17.952
Is it done?

51:18.536 --> 51:19.788
The Triads are in.

51:22.123 --> 51:23.416
You don't seem too excited.

51:25.293 --> 51:26.461
Trauma sells.

51:27.420 --> 51:29.047
Come on. We fuckin' did it.

51:29.547 --> 51:30.882
We should celebrate.

51:30.882 --> 51:33.426
I'm sure that you'll manage
just fine without me.

51:41.559 --> 51:42.894
Jesus Christ. Fine.

51:42.894 --> 51:44.020
I fucked you over.

51:45.313 --> 51:46.606
That what you wanna hear?

51:48.817 --> 51:50.985
Tell me that's not
your attempt at an apology.

51:52.195 --> 51:53.655
I didn't know
what Carmine would do.

51:54.364 --> 51:55.740
I knew somethin', but...

51:57.367 --> 51:58.451
fuckin' Arkham?

52:00.078 --> 52:01.371
His own flesh and blood?

52:05.000 --> 52:06.543
I swear, I thought
I was lookin' out for you.

52:06.543 --> 52:07.460
Bullshit.

52:08.169 --> 52:09.838
- You ratted me out.
- I ain't no rat!

52:09.838 --> 52:11.214
And I'm not the Hangman.

52:12.257 --> 52:14.718
You see the way
people look at me. Right?

52:16.428 --> 52:17.345
I know you do.

52:18.471 --> 52:20.056
And what was it all for? Hmm?

52:21.182 --> 52:22.684
For what? So you could what?

52:24.102 --> 52:25.228
Become a capo?

52:28.273 --> 52:29.941
You're not even a made man.

52:31.901 --> 52:33.278
Yeah, you're right.

52:34.070 --> 52:34.904
I ain't.

52:37.574 --> 52:39.325
I still made out
like a goddamn bandit.

52:39.325 --> 52:40.452
And you know what?

52:42.412 --> 52:43.663
It was worth it.

52:46.166 --> 52:47.125
You asked.

52:47.125 --> 52:48.501
That's my fuckin' answer.

52:48.501 --> 52:50.628
I got the club,
a Drops operation to run,

52:50.628 --> 52:51.963
my own thing.

52:55.050 --> 52:55.967
A guy like me?

52:56.593 --> 52:57.552
Gettin' all that?

52:58.553 --> 53:01.014
That don't mean nothin' to you,
maybe, but it does to me.

53:02.640 --> 53:04.267
Meant I could have
a better life.

53:07.771 --> 53:09.230
So yeah. Yeah.

53:11.733 --> 53:12.984
I don't regret what I got.

53:22.577 --> 53:23.745
Wow.

53:24.371 --> 53:25.872
You know, but I am sorry.

53:28.750 --> 53:31.670
I'm fuckin' sorry for everything
that's happened to you.

53:33.380 --> 53:34.255
Jesus.

53:34.881 --> 53:36.341
You meant something to me.

53:36.341 --> 53:37.425
Still do.

53:39.511 --> 53:40.637
And I fucked it up.

53:44.849 --> 53:46.851
And that I ain't never
gonna live down.

54:17.298 --> 54:19.300
I don't know
where to go from here.

54:24.264 --> 54:25.849
I don't know how to trust you.

54:36.776 --> 54:38.236
How 'bout
I keep showin' you how.

54:45.035 --> 54:46.578
Don't move. Don't fucking move.

54:51.499 --> 54:54.336
Oz, you think you can play us?

54:54.961 --> 54:58.340
We've been watching you, motherfucker.

55:42.175 --> 55:43.468
Holy shit.

56:13.748 --> 56:15.959
Kid, go!
We gotta fucking go! Now!

56:15.959 --> 56:17.377
W-What about Sofia?

56:17.377 --> 56:18.586
Fuck! Leave her.

56:27.679 --> 56:29.389
Goddammit, Vic!
I knew you'd come back!

56:29.389 --> 56:30.515
I fucking knew it!

56:30.515 --> 56:32.726
This is some fuckin' balls!

56:32.726 --> 56:34.477
That was incredible, kid.

56:34.477 --> 56:36.980
Jesus! We're in it now, Vic.
We're in it now.
